  "reason": "The exact Section35.2 clause is the hash mismatch disposition. Current readProject hashes the canonical stored body, rejects a mismatch with PROJECT_HASH_MISMATCH, and calls quarantine. The production quarantine transaction rechecks the current identity, preserves the original row and native Blob bytes, removes the active row, and aborts on write failure. The named quarantine controls assert the intended error, exact retained corrupt values/bytes, valid restoration and interrupted preservation; the separately required lifecycle named population includes an explicit active-row absence assertion. The declaration now correctly treats corrupt input as a negative control, with no invented implementation-mutation receipt. This is sufficient for the narrow mechanical clause with configured candidate-bound execution still required.",
  "scopeLimit": "Finite production storage/transaction-adapter mismatch controls; no actual IndexedDB/browser concurrency, whole recovery action set, all damaged object shapes, UI/device acceptance or full application conformance claim.",
